From 68df4fee32acfefb29fa18d8e7b3bd992fd872fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Phil <300208363+calicopizzadelivery@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 19:40:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] porg: label shairport-sync by its real path

porg has no separate system_ext partition -- /system_ext is a symlink to
/system/system_ext -- and file contexts are matched against the real path
when the image is built. The /system_ext form alone matched nothing, so
the binary shipped as plain system_file.

That is silent at build time and fatal at runtime: with the wrong exec
label init cannot transition the service into the shairport domain, so it
never starts, and /data/misc/airplay never gets created. Everything else
was fine -- the property came out correctly labelled shairport_prop,
because property contexts are not path-matched.

Both forms are listed so this keeps working if system_ext is ever split
into its own partition.

Found on hardware; the emulator never showed it because the policy is
porg-only and was verified by compilation alone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Ibcd389f2acd44c5b09ed8d6b30f09a2319370cbc
---
 sepolicy/private/file_contexts | 9 ++++++++-
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sepolicy/private/file_contexts b/sepolicy/private/file_contexts
index 664cb6d..1b8801c 100644
--- a/sepolicy/private/file_contexts
+++ b/sepolicy/private/file_contexts
@@ -1,2 +1,9 @@
-/system_ext/bin/shairport-sync    u:object_r:shairport_exec:s0
+# porg has no separate system_ext partition: /system_ext is a symlink to
+# /system/system_ext, and file contexts are matched against the real path when
+# the image is built. The /system_ext form alone silently does not match, and
+# the binary comes out as plain system_file -- at which point init cannot
+# transition it into the shairport domain and the service never starts. Both
+# forms are listed so this keeps working if the partition is ever split out.
+/system/system_ext/bin/shairport-sync    u:object_r:shairport_exec:s0
+/system_ext/bin/shairport-sync           u:object_r:shairport_exec:s0
 /data/misc/airplay(/.*)?          u:object_r:shairport_data_file:s0
-- 
2.43.0

